[{"text": "Hello, English learners. Welcome back to EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.9799999999999986, "end": 5.42}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 5.68, "end": 6.26}, {"text": "Today we're bringing you part two of another great lesson that we had.", "start": 6.64, "end": 9.74}, {"text": "Yes. New guy in town.", "start": 10.08, "end": 11.78}, {"text": "The new guy in town.", "start": 11.86, "end": 12.86}, {"text": "Part two.", "start": 13.0, "end": 13.44}, {"text": "Part two. Kind of a creepy story.", "start": 13.62, "end": 15.5}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 15.7, "end": 15.92}, {"text": "Yeah, and this one is also a little bit strange, a little bit weird.", "start": 16.24, "end": 19.88}, {"text": "Yeah, unusual outcome, unusual ending.", "start": 20.16, "end": 23.16}, {"text": "But it has to do a lot with invitations.", "start": 23.56, "end": 25.86}, {"text": "That's right. So an invitation is when you ask somebody to do something with you.", "start": 25.86, "end": 30.96}, {"text": "Right. A dinner invitation.", "start": 31.1, "end": 32.78}, {"text": "So we're going to be talking about invitations and inviting people to do things.", "start": 33.26, "end": 37.34}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 37.58, "end": 37.98}, {"text": "Well, with that, let's listen to the dialogue for the first time.", "start": 38.32, "end": 41.8}, {"text": "Oh, Arman, thank you for such a thoughtful invitation.", "start": 46.540000000000006, "end": 49.88}, {"text": "It's really very nice of you to invite us over for dinner.", "start": 50.540000000000006, "end": 53.72}, {"text": "Don't you think so, Ellen?", "start": 54.06, "end": 55.26}, {"text": "Oh, yes, of course. We'd love to come over. Can I bring anything?", "start": 55.879999999999995, "end": 60.04}, {"text": "No. Don't worry about it. I'll take care of everything.", "start": 60.3, "end": 63.94}, {"text": "I'll see you tonight. Come with an appetite. I know I will.", "start": 66.3, "end": 69.94}, {"text": "I don't want to go over to his place for dinner. He gives me the creeps. Why on earth did you accept?", "start": 75.32, "end": 80.78}, {"text": "Oh, come on, Ellen. It'll be nice to get to know him. Besides, he's new to the neighborhood, and it would be rude to decline his invitation.", "start": 81.12, "end": 88.9}, {"text": "I guess so. You always wrote me into things like this.", "start": 89.46000000000001, "end": 92.82}, {"text": "Ladies.", "start": 106.03999999999999, "end": 106.72}, {"text": "", "start": 106.92, "end": 106.92}, {"text": "Thank you for coming. You look delicious. I mean, beautiful. Please come in.", "start": 111.24000000000001, "end": 117.06}, {"text": "Oh, Arman, you are too kind.", "start": 120.06, "end": 123.14}, {"text": "How did I get myself into this?", "start": 123.58, "end": 125.46}, {"text": "Wow, I'm really anxious to see what happens in this dinner party.", "start": 138.66, "end": 142.36}, {"text": "Yeah, I guess we'll have to stay tuned and find out.", "start": 142.56, "end": 145.84}, {"text": "For part three.", "start": 145.96, "end": 146.68}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 146.9, "end": 147.12}, {"text": "All right. Well, we have some really great vocabulary, so I guess we can start with language takeaway.", "start": 147.62, "end": 153.02}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 155.33999999999997, "end": 156.26}, {"text": "All right. On language takeaway today, we have three great words. Erica, why don't you start us off with the first one?", "start": 157.52, "end": 163.16}, {"text": "The first word is thoughtful.", "start": 163.34, "end": 165.32}, {"text": "Thoughtful.", "start": 165.94, "end": 166.4}, {"text": "Thoughtful.", "start": 166.84, "end": 167.3}, {"text": "Thoughtful.", "start": 168.04, "end": 168.5}, {"text": "So when you're thoughtful, you're kind, right?", "start": 168.68, "end": 172.06}, {"text": "You're kind. You're considerate.", "start": 172.4, "end": 173.36}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 173.44, "end": 173.64}, {"text": "To other people.", "start": 173.78, "end": 174.4}, {"text": "You think about what the other person would like.", "start": 174.4, "end": 176.8}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 176.98, "end": 177.22}, {"text": "And you do that thing.", "start": 177.52, "end": 178.06}, {"text": "It's so thoughtful of you.", "start": 178.26, "end": 179.48}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 179.64, "end": 179.8}, {"text": "Our second phrase, give me the creeps.", "start": 180.22, "end": 182.8}, {"text": "Give me the creeps.", "start": 182.92, "end": 184.74}, {"text": "Give me the creeps.", "start": 184.9, "end": 186.66}, {"text": "This is kind of a funny phrase, but I think if we listen to some examples, we'll understand the meaning.", "start": 186.78, "end": 191.9}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 193.28, "end": 194.16}, {"text": "Horror movies give me the creeps.", "start": 196.88, "end": 198.72}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 202.78, "end": 203.6}, {"text": "Stop it.", "start": 205.8, "end": 206.64}, {"text": "You're giving me the creeps.", "start": 206.78, "end": 208.06}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 211.12, "end": 212.06}, {"text": "I saw this really scary clown.", "start": 214.38, "end": 216.64}, {"text": "It gave me the creeps.", "start": 216.8, "end": 217.82}, {"text": "So I can see this one means to make me feel uncomfortable.", "start": 220.39999999999998, "end": 223.96}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 224.58, "end": 224.78}, {"text": "It makes me feel scared.", "start": 224.9, "end": 227.26}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 227.34, "end": 227.86}, {"text": "Scared.", "start": 228.18, "end": 228.38}, {"text": "", "start": 228.58, "end": 228.58}, {"text": "Gives me the creeps.", "start": 228.92, "end": 229.9}, {"text": "And our last phrase for language takeaway, rope me into.", "start": 230.58, "end": 234.74}, {"text": "Rope me into something.", "start": 235.1, "end": 236.86}, {"text": "Rope me into something.", "start": 237.26, "end": 238.36}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 238.6, "end": 238.86}, {"text": "So if you rope me into something, it's...", "start": 238.86, "end": 241.7}, {"text": "It's like you convince me to do something that I don't really want to do.", "start": 241.7, "end": 245.76}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 245.92, "end": 246.28}, {"text": "So I roped you into lending me your car.", "start": 246.5, "end": 250.02}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 250.3, "end": 250.6}, {"text": "That was a bad idea.", "start": 250.82, "end": 251.92}, {"text": "That was a bad idea.", "start": 252.0, "end": 252.84}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 252.84, "end": 252.92}, {"text": "And you rope me into going out for beers after work.", "start": 253.12, "end": 256.62}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 256.76, "end": 256.98}, {"text": "That was a great idea.", "start": 257.16, "end": 258.08}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 258.26, "end": 258.72}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 259.62, "end": 260.12}, {"text": "So rope me into.", "start": 260.24, "end": 261.12}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 261.26, "end": 261.36}, {"text": "Convince.", "start": 261.36, "end": 261.78}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 261.98, "end": 262.1}, {"text": "All righty.", "start": 262.34, "end": 262.76}, {"text": "So I guess we could listen to our dialogue again.", "start": 262.86, "end": 265.14}, {"text": "This time a little bit slower.", "start": 265.32, "end": 266.88}, {"text": "And you'll be able to understand the language a little bit more clearly.", "start": 266.88, "end": 270.28}, {"text": "Oh, Armand.", "start": 278.48, "end": 279.76}, {"text": "Thank you for such a thoughtful invitation.", "start": 280.06, "end": 282.58}, {"text": "It's really very nice of you to invite us over for dinner.", "start": 283.8, "end": 287.44}, {"text": "Don't you think so, Ellen?", "start": 288.02, "end": 289.44}, {"text": "Oh, yes, of course.", "start": 290.06, "end": 291.8}, {"text": "We'd love to come over.", "start": 292.22, "end": 293.62}, {"text": "Can I bring anything?", "start": 293.96, "end": 295.12}, {"text": "No.", "start": 296.08, "end": 296.64}, {"text": "Don't worry about it.", "start": 296.88, "end": 298.26}, {"text": "I'll take care of everything.", "start": 298.48, "end": 300.38}, {"text": "I'll see you tonight.", "start": 300.76, "end": 302.08}, {"text": "Come with an appetite.", "start": 302.42, "end": 303.98}, {"text": "I know I will.", "start": 304.12, "end": 305.78}, {"text": "I don't want to go over to his place for dinner.", "start": 306.66, "end": 309.46}, {"text": "He gives me the creeps.", "start": 309.76, "end": 311.52}, {"text": "Why on earth did you accept?", "start": 311.76, "end": 313.76}, {"text": "Oh, come on, Ellen.", "start": 314.3, "end": 316.16}, {"text": "It would be nice to get to know him.", "start": 316.52, "end": 318.64}, {"text": "Besides, he's new to the neighborhood, and it would be rude to decline his invitation.", "start": 318.9, "end": 324.28}, {"text": "I guess so.", "start": 324.78, "end": 326.34}, {"text": "You always wrote me into things like this.", "start": 326.34, "end": 329.56}, {"text": "Ladies.", "start": 331.34000000000003, "end": 332.12}, {"text": "Thank you for coming.", "start": 333.22, "end": 334.74}, {"text": "You look delicious.", "start": 335.55999999999995, "end": 337.4}, {"text": "You look delicious.", "start": 337.42, "end": 337.96}, {"text": "I mean, beautiful.", "start": 337.96, "end": 339.46}, {"text": "Please come in.", "start": 339.8, "end": 340.94}, {"text": "Come in.", "start": 341.1, "end": 341.58}, {"text": "Oh, Armand.", "start": 342.22, "end": 343.36}, {"text": "You are too kind.", "start": 343.58, "end": 345.36}, {"text": "How did I get myself into this?", "start": 345.36, "end": 348.3}, {"text": "Well, I guess that's a lot more clear, and with that, we can start putting it together today.", "start": 352.88, "end": 358.46}, {"text": "Putting it together.", "start": 360.14, "end": 361.46}, {"text": "Today, we've got three words and phrases that we want to show you how you can put together and use differently.", "start": 362.86, "end": 369.26}, {"text": "The first one is appetite.", "start": 369.26, "end": 372.06}, {"text": "Appetite.", "start": 372.7, "end": 373.38}, {"text": "Appetite.", "start": 373.52, "end": 374.2}, {"text": "Appetite.", "start": 374.86, "end": 375.5}, {"text": "Appetite.", "start": 375.5, "end": 375.76}, {"text": "", "start": 376.02, "end": 376.02}, {"text": "Appetite.", "start": 376.04, "end": 376.08}, {"text": "So, appetite is like a strong desire for food, right?", "start": 376.08, "end": 380.08}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 380.26, "end": 380.6}, {"text": "An appetite.", "start": 380.84, "end": 381.36}, {"text": "We've got some examples that show you how to use this phrase.", "start": 381.8, "end": 385.1}, {"text": "Let's listen.", "start": 385.46, "end": 386.24}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 387.21999999999997, "end": 388.16}, {"text": "Mmm.", "start": 390.02, "end": 390.58}, {"text": "Dinner smells so good.", "start": 390.8, "end": 391.8}, {"text": "It's giving me an appetite.", "start": 392.04, "end": 392.88}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 396.46, "end": 397.32}, {"text": "You're short eating a lot.", "start": 399.54, "end": 401.0}, {"text": "You must have a big appetite.", "start": 401.2, "end": 402.92}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 406.56, "end": 407.5}, {"text": "I'm getting sick.", "start": 410.79999999999995, "end": 411.9}, {"text": "I have a fever, and I've lost my appetite.", "start": 412.08, "end": 414.48}, {"text": "Okay, so we saw some great examples of appetite.", "start": 417.84, "end": 420.74}, {"text": "You can lose your appetite.", "start": 420.74, "end": 422.34}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 422.52, "end": 422.9}, {"text": "You have a big appetite.", "start": 423.12, "end": 424.62}, {"text": "A small appetite.", "start": 424.84, "end": 426.16}, {"text": "A healthy appetite.", "start": 426.48, "end": 427.52}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 427.82, "end": 428.06}, {"text": "So, it just means...", "start": 428.36, "end": 429.68}, {"text": "A desire for food.", "start": 429.68, "end": 430.88}, {"text": "A desire for food.", "start": 431.0, "end": 431.5}, {"text": "A hunger for food.", "start": 431.5, "end": 432.06}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 432.16, "end": 432.32}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 432.44, "end": 432.58}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 433.04, "end": 433.58}, {"text": "What's our second phrase for today?", "start": 433.72, "end": 435.14}, {"text": "Get to know someone.", "start": 435.58, "end": 437.42}, {"text": "Get to know.", "start": 437.5, "end": 438.76}, {"text": "Get to know.", "start": 439.0, "end": 439.88}, {"text": "So, when you get to know someone is...", "start": 440.6, "end": 442.96}, {"text": "You talk to them, and you find out what they do.", "start": 442.96, "end": 445.52}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 445.9, "end": 446.04}, {"text": "You get more familiar with them.", "start": 446.12, "end": 447.86}, {"text": "More familiar.", "start": 447.92, "end": 448.72}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 448.94, "end": 449.12}, {"text": "For example, we can say,", "start": 449.44, "end": 450.72}, {"text": "I got to know her in Spanish class,", "start": 450.86, "end": 452.76}, {"text": "and she's a really nice person.", "start": 452.76, "end": 454.6}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 454.86, "end": 455.14}, {"text": "Or you can say,", "start": 455.32, "end": 456.32}, {"text": "Armand, Ellen, and Doris got to know each other at a dinner party.", "start": 456.56, "end": 460.56}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 460.74, "end": 461.04}, {"text": "Or you can say,", "start": 461.04, "end": 462.12}, {"text": "If you get to know me, you'll see that I'm not a bad guy.", "start": 462.32, "end": 465.64}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 465.88, "end": 466.2}, {"text": "That's true.", "start": 466.72, "end": 467.36}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 467.5, "end": 468.06}, {"text": "Get to know.", "start": 468.26, "end": 468.82}, {"text": "And our third phrase is,", "start": 469.12, "end": 470.84}, {"text": "Why on earth?", "start": 471.04, "end": 472.24}, {"text": "Why on earth?", "start": 472.7, "end": 473.94}, {"text": "Why on earth?", "start": 474.18, "end": 475.24}, {"text": "Why on earth?", "start": 475.87999999999994, "end": 477.08}, {"text": "This is like a saying.", "start": 477.24, "end": 478.64}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 478.76, "end": 479.06}, {"text": "Expression.", "start": 479.16, "end": 479.64}, {"text": "You can use it in a lot of different ways.", "start": 479.8, "end": 481.48}, {"text": "So, we've got some examples for you.", "start": 481.5, "end": 483.26}, {"text": "Let's listen.", "start": 483.42, "end": 484.12}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 485.1, "end": 486.08}, {"text": "", "start": 486.1, "end": 486.1}, {"text": "Where on earth is my phone?", "start": 488.08000000000004, "end": 490.06}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 494.14, "end": 495.08}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 495.94, "end": 496.5}, {"text": "How on earth did you learn English in one month?", "start": 498.16, "end": 501.02}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 505.96, "end": 506.92}, {"text": "What on earth is it?", "start": 509.22, "end": 511.94}, {"text": "What on earth is it?", "start": 516.82, "end": 536.88}, {"text": "Invite us over for dinner.", "start": 536.88, "end": 538.06}, {"text": "Don't you think so, Ellen?", "start": 538.54, "end": 539.58}, {"text": "Oh, yes.", "start": 540.1999999999999, "end": 540.96}, {"text": "Of course.", "start": 541.02, "end": 541.66}, {"text": "We'd love to come over.", "start": 541.9, "end": 542.98}, {"text": "Can I bring anything?", "start": 543.64, "end": 544.36}, {"text": "No.", "start": 544.64, "end": 544.84}, {"text": "Don't worry about it.", "start": 545.48, "end": 546.54}, {"text": "I'll take care of everything.", "start": 547.02, "end": 548.24}, {"text": "I'll see you tonight.", "start": 550.66, "end": 551.56}, {"text": "Come with an appetite.", "start": 551.56, "end": 553.04}, {"text": "I know I will.", "start": 553.54,