": 647.9, "end": 648.26}, {"text": "And of course, we'll publish the name of the author with the lesson.", "start": 648.58, "end": 652.9}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 652.9, "end": 653.3}, {"text": "I'm really anxious to see what ideas come up and how we can end this dialogue.", "start": 653.74, "end": 658.94}, {"text": "I know.", "start": 659.1, "end": 659.32}, {"text": "We've got a lot of really creative users out there.", "start": 659.44, "end": 661.58}, {"text": "So I'm really looking forward to this.", "start": 661.58, "end": 663.74}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 663.88, "end": 664.32}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 664.42, "end": 664.78}, {"text": "So be sure to send us your ideas, either a private message or you can post it on the", "start": 664.88, "end": 669.36}, {"text": "comment section of this lesson.", "start": 669.36, "end": 671.3}, {"text": "And any other questions or doubts, go to EnglishPod.com and you can leave them there.", "start": 671.56, "end": 676.18}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 676.3, "end": 676.48}, {"text": "Marco and I are always happy to answer your questions.", "start": 676.56, "end": 678.84}, {"text": "Okay, folks.", "start": 679.44, "end": 680.12}, {"text": "So until then, it's...", "start": 680.3, "end": 681.44}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 681.44, "end": 681.64}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 681.64, "end": 681.9}, {"text": "", "start": 681.98, "end": 681.98}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 682.9000000000001, "end": 683.46}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 683.5, "end": 683.66}, {"text": "", "start": 684.18, "end": 684.18}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 684.54, "end": 685.1}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 686.28, "end": 686.5}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 686.84, "end": 687.4}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 687.7, "end": 688.04}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 688.6, "end": 688.74}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 689.06, "end": 689.34}, {"text": "", "start": 689.48, "end": 689.48}, {"text": "", "start": 689.48, "end": 689.48}, {"text": "", "start": 689.78, "end"